our of the newly-completed secret base. When an Elemelian appears, Soji goes into action to stop the attack, but he soon finds himself in over his head. It's going to take another Tail Gear warrior to rescue him!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l6DI1JLHVWbzMS54amPfpc4yuRJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l6DI1JLHVWbzMS54amPfpc4yuRJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61474/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1423693","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Ultimaguil forces find themselves fighting an uphill battle against Twin-Tails, and Dragguildy himself decides to attack in person. Tail Red and Tail Blue step forward to stop him, but Dragguildy reveals a secret that could change everything!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/97bDUuIALdrV4eEyX1dtnGGxu6T.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97bDUuIALdrV4eEyX1dtnGGxu6T.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61474/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1423694","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Twin-Tail Club is just about ready to start, and Twoearle gives the club's classroom her own touch. With Ultimaguil on the ropes, some new reinforcements arrive to try to turn the tide, but the Twin-Tails add a reinforcement of their own.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4j3f0ky7FYNs7BoqulpxHYzqD3k.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4j3f0ky7FYNs7BoqulpxHYzqD3k.jpg","language":"x